Program:
double[] p = {0.2, 0.5, 0.3};
int[] freq = new int[3];
for (int t = 0; t < 10; t++) {
    double r = Math.random();
    double sum = 0.0;
    int j = 0;
    while (r >= sum + p[j]) {
        sum += p[j];
        j++;
    }
    freq[j]++;
}
System.out.println(freq[1]);

Question: What does the program print, and why?

